{
  "Items.BeHoney.Drink": "Opening the crystal vial, you are greeted by a super-concentrated wave of sweet honey-scent. You drink the syrupy elixir without a thought."
  "Items.BeHoney.Hair": "Your hair tingles, taking on a shiny black, bee-like sheen."
  "Items.BeHoney.Pure": "Your head aches as the honey scours away some of your corruption."
  "Items.BeHoney.Smart": "You spend a few moments analyzing the taste and texture of the honey's residue, feeling awfully smart."
  "Items.BeHoney.Special": "You uncork the bottle and pour the incredibly strong smelling concentrated honey down your throat."
}
